  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nThe most anticipated game of the century is finally here!<p></p>\n<p>Pih 2 is a one-hit-kill comedy FPS.</p>\n<p><b>ONE HIT KILLS YOU. ONE HIT KILLS THE PIHS.</b><br>\nLearn every enemy, retry instantly, and turn each humiliating death into revenge.</p>\n<p><b>THE GOAL:</b> collect all the items in each level while the pihs try to end your life.<br>\nThere’s some angry hawgs coming for you. Ever heard of a  Pihgator?  Shark-Hawg?&nbsp; Hogoon? What about a  Birdhawg?</p>\n<p>There’s some weird boats and hot air balloons you might need to use in some levels. Are they easy to drive? No. Will you crash them into things? Constantly.</p>\n<p>The first “Pih” game gave people nightmares where all they hear is “YOU GOT HAMMED”. Now it’s time for Pih 2 to make you dream about being “BACONATED”.</p>\n<p>Are you ready ?<br>\n</p>",
